cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and cite the nuclear-data evaluations used in your analysis separately."
title: "AI Nuclear Spectroscopy: An Auditable Human-AI Workflow for Nuclear-Data Screening and GCD Lifetime Analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "PanDa"
    affiliation: "Home"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JWP-p/ai-nuclear-spectroscopy"
url: "https://github.com/JWP-p/ai-nuclear-spectroscopy"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-11
abstract: >-
  A provenance-first reference implementation connecting NNDC/ENSDF data
  retrieval, source-local gamma-cascade screening, experimental-statistics
  assessment, structured scientific-agent review, explicit human approval,
  and generalized centroid-difference lifetime estimation.
keywords:
  - nuclear spectroscopy
  - gamma-gamma coincidence
  - ENSDF
  - NNDC
  - GCD lifetime
  - AI for science
  - scientific agents
